data: {"id": "6d710613d9d14c7c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1453", "run_id": "6d710613d9d14c7c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具事实，整理如下：\n\n## 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v01/workload`，UID `6743bbac-5908-452b-a35b-5f6327fe8a58`（来自历史 PromQL 结果），容器 `app`。\n\n## 已确认事实（支持 `PendingUnschedulable`）\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`phase=Pending`，未分配节点（`NODE=<none>`），无重启，已 48m 处于 Pending。\n2. **Scheduler 事件**（两次独立调用确认）：\n   - 48m 前首次：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod..`\n   - 17m 前（42m 内重复 6 次）：同样的 `Insufficient cpu` + 无可抢占 victim。\n3. **Pod CPU Req", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789107395801, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

