data: {"id": "6d710613d9d14c7c-final", "run_id": "6d710613d9d14c7c", "seq": 1458, "ts_ms": 1789107414614, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v01/workload 持续处于 Pending 状态，调度失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-6e0285b4a85b, fact-74842e785787) | FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found | 直接说明调度失败机制：集群无可用节点，且无可抢占的资源 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-edd5d078d71c) | Pod condition PodScheduled=False, reason=Unschedulable, message=\"3 Insufficient cpu\" | 确认 Pod 处于 Unschedulable 状态，原因指向 CPU 资源不足 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes (fact-93e41d08d0b1) | container resource request cpu = 100k (0.1核) | 确认该 Pod 调度请求的最小资源量 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus (fact-b65e4af15c96) | kube_pod_status_phase=1 (Pending, sample_count=1) | 确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，未见转换 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus (fact-14eb789cef16) | kube_pod_status_phase=0 (Failed, sample_count=1) | 确认 Pod 尚未进入 Failed 状态，排除因创建失败导致的终止 |\n\n证据 1 和证据 2 均明确指出集群 3 个节点均因 CPU 不足无法调度 Pod。证据 3 显示 Pod 仅需 0.1 核 CPU，说明资源缺口极小，集群整体已无余量。证据 4 与证据 5 进一步印证 Pod 停留在 Pending 状态但未失败。Kubernetes 事件与状态一致确认了 CPU 资源耗尽是唯一的阻断原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群所有节点 CPU 可分配资源已完全耗尽 → Scheduler 评估无节点满足 0.1核 Request → 无预占受害者 → Pod 维持 Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**集群 CPU 资源完全耗尽**。集群内所有可用节点（共 3 个）的 CPU 可分配资源（allocatable）已被完全占用（used），导致调度器无法为 Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload` 满足其 0.1 核（100k）的 CPU 请求。同时，由于无其他低优先级 Pod 可被抢占（No preemption victims found），调度失败且无法通过抢占恢复。此结论由 FailedScheduling 事件及 Unschedulable 状态共同确证（证据 1、2、3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 48.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v01/workload: 48.5s (Evidence 39.1s, RCA 9.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v01/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 73.224, "metrics": {"run_id": "6d710613d9d14c7c", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 73.22978615760803, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 73229.78615760803, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 69123.57115745544, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 19, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8798.070430755615, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3737.6952171325684}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15334.92374420166, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence